file: macros/src/implement.rs
breaks: A partial block reports a variant no method can forward to only in the builds in which some method forwards to every variant, so a mark under the trait method's own `#[cfg]` holds where that `cfg` does, as `docs/partial-impl-blocks.md` says.
expect: killed

find:
            let builds = quote_spanned! { site => #[cfg(any(#(#predicates),*))] };
            shape_errors(&entries, Some(&builds))
replace:
            let _ = predicates;
            shape_errors(&entries, None)
